{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06442","headline":"赠别张兵曹 · 李颀","name":"赠别张兵曹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉家萧相国，功盖五诸侯。\n勳业河山重，丹青锡命优。\n君爲禁脔壻，争看玉人游。\n荀令焚香日，潘郎振藻秋。\n新成鹦鹉赋，能衣鷫鸘裘。\n不惮轩车远，仍寻薜荔幽。\n苑梨飞绦叶，伊水净寒流。\n雪满故关道，云遮祥凤楼。\n一身轻寸禄，万物任虚舟。\n别後如相问，沧波双白鸥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06442.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06442","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}